                    },
                    "message": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mbx-systems_ahead-acquires-mbx-ushering-in-a-new-era-activity-7077309086530199553--WXU\n\nhttps://www.channele2e.com/news/supply-chain-ma-ahead-acquires-mbx-systems\n\nhttps://www.ahead.com/news/ahead-acquires-mbx/\n\nhttps://www.crn.com/news/channel-news/ahead-buys-mbx-to-boost-edge-supply-chain-hyperscale-solutions-channel-m-a\n\nSome of the results i found when searching for \"MBX\"."
