                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Do not sign up others for maintainership roles;  Unless my search failed, I haven't seen any contributions from Marvin, so this kind of maintainership is inappropriate.  I also don't see him in the latest roll call.\n\nAlexander, given that in the past you've outright ignored written rules in ways that take significant amount of maintainer time, I'm not personally comfortable sharing maintainership of this folder with you without review.  This commit is a good example that you need some level of review before checkin (given that you've not modeled the nic correctly).\n\nI would be ecstatic for you AND marvin to add yourself as reviewers and do more review.\n\nIf other maintainers feel differently, I'm happy to have that discussion."
                },
